ffdetr-768-q8.onnx
==================

The AI scan's form-field detection model.

Source: FFDetr by Joe Barrow, part of the CommonForms project
  https://huggingface.co/jbarrow/FFDetr  (FFDetr.pth, sha256
  f852e1bac18c8f435b82270fc8ff8e2ca4a2cd8869c411fa8f473f16e69585ef)
  https://github.com/jbarrow/commonforms
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

FFDetr is an RF-DETR model (Roboflow, Apache-2.0) trained on the
CommonForms dataset (Apache-2.0).

Changes made by Open PDF Filler:
  - exported to ONNX (opset 17) at a 768 × 768 input size;
  - weights stored as 8-bit integers with a per-channel scale, expanded
    back to 32-bit floats when the model loads.
How to rebuild it: scripts/model/README.md.
